### Admin Seeding REST Client
### Use this file with VS Code REST Client extension or similar tools

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@email = owner@example.com
@password = Rabbit522@

### Step 1: Login to get JWT token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Step 2: Copy the token from Step 1 response and paste it below
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Step 3: Get current user profile (optional - to verify token works)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Step 4: Seed a single admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/seed-admins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "admins": [
    {
      "email": "admin2@example.com",
      "password": "SecurePass123!",
      "role": "admin"
    }
  ]
}

### Step 5: Seed multiple admins at once
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/seed-admins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "admins": [
    {
      "email": "admin3@example.com",
      "password": "AdminPass123!",
      "role": "admin"
    },
    {
      "email": "admin4@example.com",
      "password": "ManagerPass456!",
      "role": "admin"
    },
    {
      "email": "supervisor@example.com",
      "password": "SuperPass789!",
      "role": "admin"
    }
  ]
}

### Step 6: Test new admin login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin2@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!"
}

### Health Check (no auth required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

###########################################################################
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Install "REST Client" extension in VS Code
# 2. Update @email and @password variables above with your admin credentials
# 3. Click "Send Request" on Step 1 to login
# 4. Copy the "token" value from the response
# 5. Replace "YOUR_TOKEN_HERE" in the @token variable with the actual token
# 6. Use Steps 4 or 5 to seed admins
# 7. Test new admin login with Step 6
###########################################################################

### Alternative: Quick seed template (replace EMAIL and PASSWORD)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/seed-admins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "admins": [
    {
      "email": "REPLACE_WITH_EMAIL",
      "password": "REPLACE_WITH_STRONG_PASSWORD",
      "role": "admin"
    }
  ]
}
